		Paragraph: The `Typography` of a `Markdown` is inherited by everything it generates. `Bullet markers`, `Number markers` and `Table column sizes` can come from a `For element: Markdown` rule, here the `dash` of both lists.
			Style: intro
		Text: (inherited typography)
			Style: label
		Markdown:
			Content >>
				The workshop opens from Monday to Friday.

				- Mornings, from 9 to 13.
				- Afternoons, from 15 to 18.
		Text: Typography: Font IBM Plex Serif, Size 11, Align justify, Color accent
			Style: label
		Markdown:
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Serif
				Size: 11
